#   slave flag 0x50149666 := (d1==1), and on clearing re-program TM5
#   from tempo param 4 (GetParam -> TempoBpmReloadWrite); 0x2023 ->
#   suppress byte 0x5014966A; 0x2041 -> enable byte 0x50149668
